      "comment": "Wagner: Noelle's claymore",
      "content": "Noelle's strength broke over ten swords he made, so Wagner finally built a heavy claymore reinforced by her Geo affinity, which barely solved the problem. A rumour even says the episode nearly sent him into despairing seclusion. The wiki links this weapon to the Favonius Greatsword; canon text only says it was custom made.",
