    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Pinky the Rabbit",
        "drinking contest",
        "Lawrence"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Wagner",
        "blacksmith"
      ],
      "comment": "Wagner: Naming bet",
      "content": "Wagner loves drinking contests, and the stakes grow wilder as he drinks. He lost to Schulz and renamed the shop; later he beat Lawrence's father, a Fontaine merchant, who then had to name his son Lawrence. Had Wagner lost, he would have had to name his prized weapon \"Pinky the Rabbit\". Lawrence has no tie to the Lawrence Clan.",
