        "dragon",
        "storm"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Wagner",
        "forge"
      ],
      "comment": "Wagner: Stormterror attack",
      "content": "When Stormterror struck Mondstadt, Wagner stayed at his forge. He said it would take a far bigger storm than that to keep him away, and that the iron spends all day being hammered into shape. After the crisis he says dragon or no dragon, he will be there, and that the fires of Wagner's smithy will not go out.",
